<Base title="Cloud cost optimisation" current="services">
  <h1>Cloud cost optimisation</h1>
  <p>Finding where cloud spend goes, removing waste, and setting up the controls to keep it down.</p>
  <h2>What's included</h2>
  <p>An analysis of where the money goes, practical changes ranked by savings against effort, and the budgets and alerts that stop costs drifting back up. Savings are measured, not estimated.</p>
  <h2>Who it's for</h2>
  <p>Teams whose cloud bill has grown faster than their usage, or who can't yet explain what they're paying for.</p>
  <p><a class="button" href="/contact/">Talk about your cloud bill</a></p>
</Base>
